              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made as written and these were just ok. Perfect if you want to mask the sprouts I suppose. There was way too much cheese and that is pretty much all you could taste. I agree with another review and I'd roast them next time instead of boiling and cut the cheese sauce by half at least. Overall easy though and great if you are introducing them to picky kiddos.",
